SplitMind patch 0012 for OpenConnector v1.9.2 (after 0001-0005 and 0009-0011).
Upstream issue: not filed yet.
Email watch hardening: #110 wider code redaction, #111 retention sweep limits.
From 3dd0a261bccb8b312cc9e3e920a7ad281ed06c7a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SplitMind <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:22:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(email-watch): harden redaction and retention sweep for
 #110, #111

#110: code redaction removes zero-width characters and covers any Unicode
decimal digit with one separator (whitespace incl. no-break spaces, dot,
hyphens and dashes, minus) between digits.
#111: the sweep purges unwatched connections with no bound-parameter cap (read
names, delete in chunks of 50), handles each table on its own, and migration
0020 adds indexes for the sweep scans. Also moves MAIL_WATCH_SERVICE above the
ActionRunner JSDoc.
